<title>ISRAEL: Clal Israel Q2 net lower.</title>
<headline>Clal Israel Q2 net lower.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Clal Israel Ltd.</p>
<p>			 (In thousands of shekels)</p>
<p>			 Q2 96	 Q2 95	6-MTH 96    6-MTH 95</p>
<p>Revenue		1,264,436   1,321,300  2,637,382   2,493,805</p>
<p>Net profit		44,577	58,913    107,705	76,920</p>
<p>Clal Israel is on of Israel's leading business conglomerates.</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
